    "degrade_reason": null,
    "globalConstraints": "- The sandbox holds no credential: the celld install verifies a digest recorded in the plugin and never runs `gh attestation verify` on the VM, the setup script still contains no secret and no `ANTHROPIC` string, and no task adds a token, a bucket or a Cloudflare credential to any VM-side file.\n- The setup script stays under the fleet's own budget of `SETUP_SCRIPT_BUDGET_BYTES` (9216) for the render of any run number, and every tool it installs is pinned by version and verified by a digest before it is installed.\n- A run that names no state exam is sized exactly as at BASE: `--cpu min(cap, 2 + ceil(W/3))` and `--memory min(cap, 2 + W) GB`.\n- No new event kind is appended to `events.jsonl`, no new assignment key is added to the VM comment, and nothing under `fleet/roles/` changes.\n- Findings are about the result \u2014 what the rendered script, the launch line, the sims and the documents now say \u2014 never about the order the work was done in, the number of commits, or whether a test was written before its code.",
